{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320306001:1":{"text":"突然呼び出して申し訳ない、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿。","source_cn":"原谅我的冒昧，<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1860D5B58CD20628","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"突然呼び出して申し訳ない、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿。","female":"突然呼び出して申し訳ない、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿。","variant_male_record_index":"144176","variant_female_record_index":"144177","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320306002:1":{"text":"ヴェリカさんから聞いたのですが、画家さんを探しているんですか？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡说你想找一位画家，对方是谁呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0A88F4583A571D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320306003:1":{"text":"ああ。ひとまずこの絵を見てほしい。","source_cn":"来吧，先看看这幅画。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2A76A7BD4CCD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::2":{"text":"ボロボロの絵画","source_cn":"残破的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF773940056FD220C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320306004:1":{"text":"どう思う？","source_cn":"你们觉得如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8570D8B993F25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320306004":{"text":"どう思う？","source_cn":"你们觉得如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8570D8B993F25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320306007:2":{"text":"この絵の作者さんを探してほしいのですか？","source_cn":"这幅画的作者，就是你想找的那个人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F54B8B6D994B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320306008:1":{"text":"ああ。","source_cn":"是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B8A1FE2CBD23183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320306009:1":{"text":"この絵は技量もさることながら、「魂」を感じられる。わずか数筆で雰囲気を見事に表現しているのを見るに、この作者の実力は本物だ。","source_cn":"在我看来，这幅画画技高超，充满灵气。能用寥寥几笔就完成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D2D81AC03BDD33E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320306010:1":{"text":"ただ残念なことに、この絵は未完成な上に破損もひどい……一体なぜこうなったかのかが知りたい。","source_cn":"只可惜这幅画没有完成，也不知遭遇过什么，竟然破损至此…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AEE25C1C1E859C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320306011:1":{"text":"だが、長いこと隠居していた僕では、他に頼れる者がいなくてな。だから君たちを呼んでもらったのだ。","source_cn":"但我一直隐居，认识的人类屈指可数。只能拜托瓦丽卡请你们帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD45CB5EDB78742","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320306012:1":{"text":"ちなみに、この絵はどこから？","source_cn":"唔，那你知道这幅画是哪里来的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x871AB2A0A7874AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320306013:1":{"text":"以前より芸術品の取引をしている商人から、僕が安価で買い取ったものだ。","source_cn":"这是一位为我长期提供艺术品的商人送来的，我用很低的价格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047C50FBFFB4C838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320306014:1":{"text":"商人の名は<style=\"highlight\">クロガラス</style>。本名は知らないが、黒沼の森にやって来る数少ない人間のひとりだ。","source_cn":"她自称<style=highlight>黑鸦商人</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB48216BCC0C6A625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320306015:1":{"text":"その方の外見を教えてくれますか？","source_cn":"没关系。既然你和她做生意，总见过她的长相吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2413DEB53DCA745F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320306016:1":{"text":"……残念だが、彼女と直接会ったことはない。","source_cn":"……很遗憾，我和她从未见过面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670A0418908F5B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320306017:1":{"text":"取引する時はいつも、彼女が約束の場所に品物を置き、僕が取りに行く時に商品代と手間賃を置いていく形だ。","source_cn":"每次交易，都是由她将货物放在约定的地点，我取走时留下购...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C412F1F8B963A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320306018:1":{"text":"本名も顔も分からないとなると……困りましたね……","source_cn":"不知道真名也不知道长相……这下可难办了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x873B7312F45077D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320306019:1":{"text":"だったら、その取引の場所に行ってみるのはどうですか？なにか手がかりが残ってるかも！","source_cn":"要不我们去柳博米尔和黑鸦商人约定的地方看看？说不定对方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8444E1B0447A88D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320306020:2":{"text":"手間をかける。黒沼の森の<style=\"highlight\">滝から北にある枯木の下</style>が、僕と彼女の取引場所だ。","source_cn":"只能麻烦你们过去看看了。黑沼森林<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDBC859BA18BA8B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320306021:0":{"text":"それって、荘園に続くあの近道から行ける所？","source_cn":"你说的地方是不是在通往庄园的那条近路上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF54616DA2F8CFC61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320306022:0":{"text":"……沼地を突っ切ることになってもかまわないなら、確かに近道ではある。","source_cn":"……如果你愿意蹚过沼泽，那确实是条近路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BC904E2B886E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1320306023:0":{"text":"ここに来る途中、あそこに人間がいるのを見かけたの。もしかしたらその商人かも。","source_cn":"我来的时候看到那里有个人类，或许就是你说的黑鸦商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B020493C4FE6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1320306024:0":{"text":"人間が相手なら、私も姿を見せるべきではないわね。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、ここはあなたにお願いするわ。","source_cn":"和人类打交道的事，恐怕我也不方便出面。<style=s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x19A460D18C5CEEDB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"人間が相手なら、私も姿を見せるべきではないわね。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、ここはあなたにお願いするわ。","female":"人間が相手なら、私も姿を見せるべきではないわね。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、ここはあなたにお願いするわ。","variant_male_record_index":"144202","variant_female_record_index":"144203","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1320306025:1":{"text":"ご安心ください！必ずやその画家さんの情報を手に入れてみせますよ！","source_cn":"放心吧，我们一定会帮柳博米尔打听到那位画家的消息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E50E8C4903B1647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor